Personal test installs for Apoorv only — not App Store / Play Store release shipping.

After every code change that affects the apps, rebuild, install, and open on my connected phones before finishing (unless I explicitly say not to or a device is disconnected):

- **iOS**: Release build only. Install over the existing App Store / prior install. Never uninstall first. Launch `com.apoorvdarshan.calorietracker` after install.
- **Android**: Debug build only (`com.apoorvdarshan.calorietracker.debug`). Use `adb install -r` over the existing debug install. Never uninstall first or clear app data. Launch the debug MainActivity after install. Do not expect to overwrite the Play Store package (signature mismatch).
- Preserve existing on-device data unless I explicitly ask to wipe or reinstall clean.
- Prefer the currently connected device (Apoorv’s iPhone / USB Android) when installing.
- After promoting workout images, rebuild so Android assets are refreshed before install; verify a sample promoted frame is in the APK.
